    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n68259" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μοιμυάω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>compress the lips</i> or <i>make grimaces</i> in sign of
			displeasure, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>, v.l. for
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μοιμυλλᾶν</span></b>  in <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.90
			</span></i>; hence restored for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί μοι
			μυᾶτε</span>; in <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				126
			</span></i>.</div>
